    {"id": "not_understood_03", "event": "NotUnderstood", "group": "Voice", "text": "के कह रया सै? समझ्या ना।", "hash": "8638a573c39f"},
    {"id": "not_understood_04", "event": "NotUnderstood", "group": "Voice", "text": "भाई, न्यू बोल: रोहतक चाल, या गाणा बजा।", "hash": "7529bacb8e07"},
    {"id": "cancelled_01", "event": "Cancelled", "group": "Voice", "text": "ठीक सै भाई, कोए बात ना।", "hash": "4cbd1a6f4391"},
